<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank net currency reserves fall in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank net currency reserves fall in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Friday show that net currency reserves fell to about 102.7 billion marks in the week ending April 15, from about 102.8 billion in the week ending April 7.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p>    Banking week ended		    April 15    April 7</p>
<p>    Gross currency reserves	     118.0	   118.2</p>
<p>    Foreign liabilities		    15.3	    15.4</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
